<title>UK: OPEC basket price fell to $19.19 last week.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price fell to $19.19 last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes fell to $19.19 per barrel last week from $20.22 the previous week, the OPEC news agency OPECNA said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said that according to figures released by the OPEC Secretariat in Vienna, the price of the basket so far this year (up to February 27) has averaged $21.84 a barrel.</p>
<p>The basket averaged $23.19 in January, $23.51 in December and $22.23 in November.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7629</p>
